      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T00-09-22-563Z/days/day-0001.md",
        "extractedDay": 1,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T01:48:12.446Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-boo-g-yp0gxy",
      "text": "Bones, watch him bounce back off the pavement again like it's a trampoline made of divine spite - that's a discount rate nobody in Hell's actuary table can touch.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "boo-g",
        "name": "Boo G",
        "category": "wanderers"
      },
      "pool": "salesPitch",
      "mood": "annoyed",
      "moodIntensity": 0,
      "contextTags": [],
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 78,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T00-09-22-563Z/days/day-0002.md",
        "extractedDay": 2,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T01:48:12.446Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-boo-g-t6on9t",
      "text": "Clausen, that smug little smile's a receipt I ain't signed yet - 4 and 3 just means you lost enough to know how it tastes. Meanwhile the new kid's out there hitting personal bests on domains and still owes Boo G 125 gold, so trust me, I collect either way - dice or debt, Hell don't lose paperwork, baby, it remixes the invoice.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "boo-g",
        "name": "Boo G",
        "category": "wanderers"
      },
      "pool": "gamblingTrashTalk",
      "mood": "threatening",
      "moodIntensity": 0,
      "contextTags": [
        "weather:frost"
      ],
      "triggers": {
        "debtTension": "minor"
      },
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 78,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T00-09-22-563Z/days/day-0004.md",
        "extractedDay": 4,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T01:48:12.447Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-boo-g-dca9r",
      "text": "Two losses don't scare me, Body Count - 0-2 just means the invoice ain't due yet, and Hell always collects on its own clock. You count endings, I count debts, and right now the newcomer's 125 in the red just like your last four contracts came up short of a real finish. Shake 'em up quick - I got a warehouse full of patience and none of it's for sale to a man who talks less than my silent stock.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "boo-g",
        "name": "Boo G",
        "category": "wanderers"
      },
      "pool": "threat",
      "mood": "threatening",
      "moodIntensity": -2,
      "contextTags": [],
      "triggers": {
        "debtTension": "minor"
      },
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 78,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T00-09-22-563Z/days/day-0007.md",
        "extractedDay": 7,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T01:48:12.449Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-boo-g-6p9w47",
      "text": "Well if it ain't 2-and-0 herself, still stitching wins together like that bow's holding the whole ledger shut. Civic dust's got everybody's teeth grinding but you look paid in full, medic - question is whether that's your price or somebody else's favor walking around unclaimed. B'S HITS is open, Closed is a state of mind, and so is that shadow of yours, way I hear it.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "boo-g",
        "name": "Boo G",
        "category": "wanderers"
      },
      "pool": "salesPitch",
      "mood": "generous",
      "moodIntensity": 0,
      "contextTags": [
        "weather:dust"
      ],
      "triggers": {
        "debtTension": "minor"
      },
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 78,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T00-24-14-611Z/days/day-0001.md",
        "extractedDay": 1,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T01:48:12.450Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-boo-g-34lue5",
      "text": "Bones, that boy fell down again and got back up like gravity owes *him* money - now that's a debt even your ledger can't collect. Kid's 0-and-dead a dozen times over and still walking, you sure you're not the one who oughta be filing paperwork on that?",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "boo-g",
        "name": "Boo G",
        "category": "wanderers"
      },
      "pool": "threat",
      "mood": "threatening",
      "moodIntensity": 0,
      "contextTags": [],
      "triggers": {
        "debtTension": "minor"
      },
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 78,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T00-24-14-611Z/days/day-0002.md",
        "extractedDay": 2,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T01:48:12.450Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-boo-g-a4i8aa",
      "text": "Two losses don't scare me, quiet man - the dice don't know my name yet, that's all. You count endings, I count invoices, and the kid's tab of 125 says he ain't ending anytime soon. Smug's a look good on you till B'S HITS puts a price on it - and everything's got a price.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "boo-g",
        "name": "Boo G",
        "category": "wanderers"
      },
      "pool": "gamblingTrashTalk",
      "mood": "threatening",
      "moodIntensity": -2,
      "contextTags": [],
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 78,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T00-24-14-611Z/days/day-0007.md",
        "extractedDay": 7,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T01:48:12.452Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-boo-g-2ao5lm",
      "text": "Willy, you one-eyed omen, still counting my losses with that single eye like it's cheaper than two - 0 and 2 stings less when I know Hell's already filing the paperwork on my comeback. Newcomer's sitting pretty on a new personal best domain and still owes me 125 gold, so don't get comfortable, the house always collects, even from the dead.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "boo-g",
        "name": "Boo G",
        "category": "wanderers"
      },
      "pool": "gamblingTrashTalk",
      "mood": "threatening",
      "moodIntensity": -2,
      "contextTags": [],
      "triggers": {
        "debtTension": "minor"
      },
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 78,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T00-29-16-854Z/days/day-0008.md",
        "extractedDay": 8,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T01:48:12.452Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-boo-g-uxqpgz",
      "text": "Clutch roll from the clutch case - General, your boy's clawing new personal bests while my streak sits at one loss and his tab sits at 125 gold unpaid. Hell don't lose paperwork, it remixes the invoice, and right now that invoice's got interest walking on two legs. You want to cosign his debt while he's hot, or you want to let B'S HITS collect the old-fashioned way?",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "boo-g",
        "name": "Boo G",
        "category": "wanderers"
      },
      "pool": "gamblingTrashTalk",
      "mood": "scared",
      "moodIntensity": 0,
      "contextTags": [],
      "triggers": {
        "debtTension": "notable"
      },
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 78,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T00-29-16-854Z/days/day-0009.md",
        "extractedDay": 9,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T01:48:12.453Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-boo-g-ud4sle",
      "text": "Keith, you run so fast the dice barely catch you blinkin', four wins ain't luck, that's Doppler effect. But don't let that hot streak fool you into thinkin' speed pays debts - your boy's still 125 deep in my ledger, and Hell don't lose paperwork, it remixes the invoice.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "boo-g",
        "name": "Boo G",
        "category": "wanderers"
      },
      "pool": "gamblingTrashTalk",
      "mood": "threatening",
      "moodIntensity": -2,
      "contextTags": [
        "weather:frost"
      ],
      "triggers": {
        "playerArchetype": "chaotic",
        "debtTension": "minor"
      },
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 78,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T00-29-16-854Z/days/day-0011.md",
        "extractedDay": 11,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T01:48:12.453Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-boo-g-frofpy",
      "text": "Bones, that whistle's for practice fouls, not for blowing on my tab - put it down before Hell hears a wrong note and remixes your invoice too. Two losses is a lean, not a fall, and that newcomer's 125 still sits pretty on my books collecting interest like a saint collects sins. You want to smirk about your 3-and-5, fine - smirking's free, but everything else in this corridor's got a price tag, and yours is due right after his.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "boo-g",
        "name": "Boo G",
        "category": "wanderers"
      },
      "pool": "salesPitch",
      "mood": "threatening",
      "moodIntensity": -2,
      "contextTags": [],
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 78,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T00-29-16-854Z/days/day-0012.md",
        "extractedDay": 12,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T01:48:12.454Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-boo-g-a5nefg",
      "text": "Willy, that eye of yours seen three straight bricks and you still ain't blinked. Hell's running my invoice tonight, remixing every loss into a new line of credit I didn't ask for. Kid owes me 125, universe owes me a win, and all I got is a streak colder than the Saucer's coffee.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "boo-g",
        "name": "Boo G",
        "category": "wanderers"
      },
      "pool": "gamblingBrag",
      "mood": "annoyed",
      "moodIntensity": -3,
      "contextTags": [
        "weather:wild",
        "loss_streak",
        "tilted"
      ],
      "triggers": {
        "streak": {
          "type": "loss",
          "min": 3
        },
        "debtTension": "minor"
      },
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 78,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T00-36-08-597Z/days/day-0015.md",
        "extractedDay": 15,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T01:48:12.455Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-boo-g-nz49oh",
      "text": "Two losses ain't a curse, Clausen, it's a warm-up. Sun's got your face lit up like a receipt, so let's see if your dice read better than your paperwork. Newcomer owes me 125, you win this and I'll add your name to the invoice too.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "boo-g",
        "name": "Boo G",
        "category": "wanderers"
      },
      "pool": "gamblingTrashTalk",
      "mood": "threatening",
      "moodIntensity": -2,
      "contextTags": [],
      "triggers": {
        "debtTension": "minor"
      },
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 78,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T00-36-08-597Z/days/day-0020.md",
        "extractedDay": 20,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T01:48:12.457Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-boo-g-ned2zh",
      "text": "General, your boy owes me 125 gold and a prayer he can't afford, so tonight I roll to collect on both fronts. Fourteen and twelve, huh, funny how the corpses still count wins like they matter down here. Shake em quick, Hell don't lose paperwork, it remixes the invoice.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "boo-g",
        "name": "Boo G",
        "category": "wanderers"
      },
      "pool": "gamblingTrashTalk",
      "mood": "threatening",
      "moodIntensity": 0,
      "contextTags": [
        "weather:void"
      ],
      "triggers": {
        "debtTension": "minor"
      },
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 78,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T00-56-35-071Z/days/day-0033.md",
        "extractedDay": 33,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T01:48:12.462Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-boo-g-nza41w",
      "text": "General, your boy's 125 in the hole with me and still betting his own bones like they're house money. Heaven's watching, sure, but the invoice don't care whose head-chair is empty. You want to cosign that debt, or you just here to watch him die on somebody else's clock this time?",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "boo-g",
        "name": "Boo G",
        "category": "wanderers"
      },
      "pool": "gamblingTrashTalk",
      "mood": "scared",
      "moodIntensity": 0,
      "contextTags": [
        "weather:void"
      ],
      "triggers": {
        "debtTension": "minor"
      },
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 78,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T00-56-35-071Z/days/day-0033.md",
        "extractedDay": 33,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T01:48:12.462Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-boo-g-7416xu",
      "text": "Willy, that eye of yours ever spot a kid running from a bill? 'Cause Never Die Guy's 125 in the red with me and climbing everywhere he goes. Twenty and sixteen, huh, you're due for a win, maybe you take his debt off my hands and call it even odds.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "boo-g",
        "name": "Boo G",
        "category": "wanderers"
      },
      "pool": "threat",
      "mood": "generous",
      "moodIntensity": 0,
      "contextTags": [],
      "triggers": {
        "debtTension": "minor"
      },
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 78,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T00-56-35-071Z/days/day-0034.md",
        "extractedDay": 34,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T01:48:12.462Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-boo-g-o37w7m",
      "text": "Doc Voss, you're a sight for a two-win streak. Your boy the recruit still owes me 125, dying so much he can't keep his own tab straight, maybe you should bottle a serum for that.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "boo-g",
        "name": "Boo G",
        "category": "wanderers"
      },
      "pool": "gamblingBrag",
      "mood": "pleased",
      "moodIntensity": 2,
      "contextTags": [],
      "triggers": {
        "debtTension": "minor"
      },
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 78,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T01-00-57-745Z/days/day-0038.md",
        "extractedDay": 38,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T01:48:12.464Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-boo-g-3rsuzb",
      "text": "Ante 2, Clausen, ante 2. Kid's dying faster than my patience for your paperwork jokes. Meanwhile my streak's sitting pretty at two, and that 125 he owes me just keeps collecting dust and interest.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "boo-g",
        "name": "Boo G",
        "category": "wanderers"
      },
      "pool": "gamblingTrashTalk",
      "mood": "pleased",
      "moodIntensity": 2,
      "contextTags": [],
      "triggers": {
        "debtTension": "notable"
      },
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 78,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T01-00-57-745Z/days/day-0047.md",
        "extractedDay": 47,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T01:48:12.466Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-boo-g-fopira",
      "text": "Sixteen wins counting endings, huh. Funny thing about that boy you're hunting, he's got a body that won't stay tallied, and I've got a tab of 125 gold that won't stay paid. Sit down, Body Count, let's see whose luck holds tonight.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "boo-g",
        "name": "Boo G",
        "category": "wanderers"
      },
      "pool": "gamblingTrashTalk",
      "mood": "threatening",
      "moodIntensity": -2,
      "contextTags": [],
      "triggers": {
        "playerArchetype": "chaotic"
      },
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 78,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T01-00-57-745Z/days/day-0048.md",
        "extractedDay": 48,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T01:48:12.466Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-boo-g-3pjkdh",
      "text": "General, two losses deep and you still walk up smiling like the bones owe you money. Your boy's tab sits at 125 and climbing, so tonight I'm rolling for interest. Toss the dice, cowboy, Hell's got room on the shelf for one more losing streak.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "boo-g",
        "name": "Boo G",
        "category": "wanderers"
      },
      "pool": "gamblingTrashTalk",
      "mood": "threatening",
      "moodIntensity": -2,
      "contextTags": [],
      "triggers": {
        "debtTension": "notable"
      },
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 78,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T01-00-57-745Z/days/day-0048.md",
        "extractedDay": 48,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T01:48:12.466Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-boo-g-awabj9",
      "text": "King James, five and two while I'm two losses deep, don't rub salt in a man who sells the salt. Newcomer walks through fire and owes me a hundred twenty-five still sitting pretty, so I got worse problems than your record tonight. Hell don't lose paperwork, it remixes the invoice, and mine's due.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "boo-g",
        "name": "Boo G",
        "category": "wanderers"
      },
      "pool": "threat",
      "mood": "threatening",
      "moodIntensity": -2,
      "contextTags": [
        "weather:dust"
      ],
      "triggers": {
        "debtTension": "minor"
      },
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 78,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T01-00-57-745Z/days/day-0053.md",
        "extractedDay": 53,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T01:48:12.467Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-boo-g-ilty0n",
      "text": "Smug looks good on you now, Willy, but smug don't survive a third loss. I've watched three losses turn a man into paperwork, and Hell's already got a drawer open with your name half filled in.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "boo-g",
        "name": "Boo G",
        "category": "wanderers"
      },
      "pool": "reaction",
      "mood": "pleased",
      "moodIntensity": 0,
      "contextTags": [
        "weather:death"
      ],
      "triggers": {
        "playerArchetype": "defensive"
      },
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 78,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T01-00-57-745Z/days/day-0058.md",
        "extractedDay": 58,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T01:48:12.468Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-boo-g-xt911z",
      "text": "Stitch, that tilt on you reads like unpaid interest, and I'm one win deep so don't test my mood either. Newcomer's still 125 in the hole to me, you want to co-sign his tab or you just here to bleed on my carpet.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "boo-g",
        "name": "Boo G",
        "category": "wanderers"
      },
      "pool": "challenge",
      "mood": "scared",
