        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-boo-g-uwfunf",
      "text": "Twelve and six, Keith, cute record for a man who runs from his own bar tab. Your boy's hot streak don't touch the 125 he owes me, interest walks even when he's winning. Tell him B'S HITS takes gold, favors, or a piece of that luck, his pick.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "boo-g",
        "name": "Boo G",
        "category": "wanderers"
      },
      "pool": "gamblingTrashTalk",
      "mood": "scared",
