        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T01:48:12.470Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-boo-g-3343xv",
      "text": "General, that clutch roll just bought your boy another lap around the wheel, but 125 gold don't evaporate 'cause the dice got lucky. Heaven's watching, sure, but even The One files receipts. B'S HITS is open, and his tab's still breathing louder than he does.",
      "speaker": {
