      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T01-00-57-745Z/days/day-0063.md",
        "extractedDay": 63,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T01:48:12.470Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-boo-g-4m4swd",
      "text": "That eye of yours rolled hot, One Eye, but hot don't mean honest. Two losses ain't a pattern, it's a warning shot, and I already got a Never Die Guy running up my books at 125 gold. Smirk while you can, Hell don't lose paperwork, it remixes the invoice, and yours is coming due next.",
      "speaker": {
