        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T01:48:12.470Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-boo-g-5g0mmw",
      "text": "Keith, fast feet, thirteen wins, you're making the rest of us look bad standing still. Your boy's still sitting on 125 he owes me, tell him Heaven's got no exit that outruns a ledger.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "boo-g",
