      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T01-00-57-745Z/days/day-0063.md",
        "extractedDay": 63,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T01:48:12.470Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-boo-g-d5pt3z",
      "text": "Two losses ain't a streak, Body Count, it's a warning shot. You count endings, I count what's owed, and that boy's tab is longer than your kill sheet. Roll your bones quiet, I got a customer who never stays finished, and neither does my patience.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "boo-g",
