      },
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 78,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T01-25-39-241Z/days/day-0066.md",
        "extractedDay": 66,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T01:48:12.471Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-boo-g-k4glqm",
      "text": "Smug's a currency too, Doc, and you're spending above your limit. 35 and 33 ain't a hot streak, it's a coin flip with good lighting. Save the shine for the King, down here Hell still remixes every invoice, yours included.",
      "speaker": {
