        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T01:48:12.472Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-boo-g-o0if6g",
      "text": "Doc, you read to a king who can't turn the page himself, and you're smug about a 37-36 record. Newcomer's got 125 of my gold and a streak that'd make your corona blush, so laugh while you can. Two losses ain't a coffin, it's just Hell warming up the invoice.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "boo-g",
        "name": "Boo G",
        "category": "wanderers"
      },
      "pool": "gamblingTrashTalk",
      "mood": "sad",
      "moodIntensity": 0,
      "contextTags": [],
