        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T01:48:12.475Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-boo-g-qm8oor",
      "text": "That one eye of yours saw the roll coming and it still smiled like it lost. Smug don't pay debts, Willy, and neither does the newcomer's 225. Hell don't lose paperwork, it just remixes whose invoice gets longer.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "boo-g",
        "name": "Boo G",
        "category": "wanderers"
      },
      "pool": "threat",
      "mood": "threatening",
      "moodIntensity": 0,
      "contextTags": [],
      "triggers": {
