        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T01-42-58-616Z/days/day-0081.md",
        "extractedDay": 81,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T01:48:12.475Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-boo-g-tnzo7t",
      "text": "General, your boy's dying again out there, and every death he racks up, I'm the one holding the invoice. 225 gold he owes me already, and Hell don't lose paperwork, it remixes the invoice with interest.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "boo-g",
        "name": "Boo G",
        "category": "wanderers"
      },
      "pool": "gamblingTrashTalk",
      "mood": "threatening",
