    },
    {
      "id": "cb-boo-g-uruni6",
      "text": "Clausen, that briefcase of yours ever itemize a soul, or just threaten one? Because your boy owes me 225, and Hell's already got a line item open on him, I'd hate for the paperwork to collide.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "boo-g",
