        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T01:48:12.476Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-boo-g-ip8wxr",
      "text": "Nine and four while you're chained to a chair, King. Meanwhile your boy's out there racking up 225 on my books and calling dying a hobby. Fluorescent lights hum, coffee's dead, and I'm the only one in this room still keeping score honest.",
      "speaker": {
